{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>In death, the legend of Davy Jones splits in two:</strong> the Head that commands, and the Body that fights.</i><br>    <br><i> Bound together in a cursed alliance, you must carve your way through The Locker \u2014 a pirate underworld shattered into islands floating on an infinite Sea of Clouds. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight, fly, and conquer hell itself to reclaim your legend.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/47ee9b5ee1f881d7048c2fc28f4af61c.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JONES \u2014 The Body, The Fighter, The Ground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Control the powerful, headless body \u2014 <strong>Jones</strong> \u2014 and push through everything that stands in your way. Master visceral first-person combat with sword, gun and your own talking skull \u2014 <strong>Davy</strong> \u2014 who cracks wise and guides the way. <br>    <br><strong>Explore the shattered islands of The Locker</strong> \u2014 an open pirate underworld of cursed shores, sunken ruins, and secrets waiting beneath the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every treasure you claim, every soul you free, and every victory on the ground fuels your might in the skies \u2014 <strong>because death here is only the beginning.</strong>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAVY \u2014 The Head, The Captain, The Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command the skies as <strong>Davy</strong> \u2014 the sharp-tongued captain\u2019s skull who never stopped scheming, even after death. <br><strong>Take the helm of Abby</strong>, your colossal living ship \u2014 <strong>half whale, half war machine</strong> \u2014 and soar across the infinite Sea of Clouds. <br> <br>Recruit Officers with unique powers, upgrade your ship, and lead them into evolving roguelite Hunts filled with explosive sky battles and colossal <strong>Behemoths</strong>. <br> <br>Strategize, adapt, and abordage enemy vessels as you carve your way to power. <br>Every victory in the skies strengthens your dominion on the ground \u2014 <strong>and every defeat only feeds the storm.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Pirate Action-Adventure:</strong> A story-driven journey through a surreal underworld that bridges brutal land combat and epic sky battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BODY \u00d7 HEAD:</strong> You are both the Muscle and the Brain. Control the headless body on the islands, and command the skies as the captain\u2019s skull aboard your living ship, Abby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral First-Person Combat:</strong> Slash, shoot, and grapple through intense close-quarters encounters using your own skull as a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail Your Living Ship:</strong> Gather your crew and command Abby across the endless Sea of Clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Hunts:</strong> Engage in evolving sky encounters and give Orders to shape each run \u2014 tactical choices that empower your crew with unique abilities and upgrades as you climb toward legendary Behemoths like the Kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Locker:</strong> Explore a pirate hell of shattered islands and infinite skies \u2014 where death is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two halves. <i>One purpose.</i><br>Grow into power, gather your crew, and conquer The Locker.<br><strong>Become the legend that hell itself couldn\u2019t drown.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sail Ho!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/2c85af15504a76b3168d9341b8ff96f3cda82349.jpg"},{"name":"Decapitation for Dummies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/c3814e584d42d04462fe106d71f28dc596837326.jpg"},{"name":"Kraken't","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/2b3fccc4f5ad67d36c9cf0672ec7b612b2fb1ea9.jpg"},{"name":"Kegs Dead, Baby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/92e95aa7601045e0a4502e3af240df096d5ec6c8.jpg"},{"name":"Ashes to Ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/6f24bc4decf7fb6888189a79e60d1799d8711af0.jpg"},{"name":"Devil\u2019s Due","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/638a2866e9c56844033bad88103ec9712bba693b.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/a54d038ae42780426222eee386e7cc8ab98ca00c.jpg"},{"name":"Five-Finger Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/bec8b7e398f6bc7e7830da118f57a7c51eda61aa.jpg"},{"name":"Board \u2019Em All!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/24ad1478f4ffbe15de6292ff7a0481f95afbd358.jpg"},{"name":"Boneyard Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2611170/47c37f7457934875608507d559b96a842137266a.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2611170?t=1765790443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/bfa3f0065624c8ec8ec51aa6cd2d6c0bb5700b69/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765790443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/74452f9e9cdd3094933a648e0b43d2e213fa1220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765790443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/74452f9e9cdd3094933a648e0b43d2e213fa1220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765790443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6