tered islands of The Locker</strong> \u2014 an open pirate underworld of cursed shores, sunken ruins, and secrets waiting beneath the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every treasure you claim, every soul you free, and every victory on the ground fuels your might in the skies \u2014 <strong>because death here is only the beginning.</strong>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" width=1170 height=674 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/f3ec9937953cbef845f5c36fff962e5e.webm?t=1765790443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAVY \u2014 The Head, The Captain, The Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command the skies as <strong>Davy</strong> \u2014 the sharp-tongued captain\u2019s skull who never stopped scheming, even after death. <br><strong>Take the helm of Abby</strong>, your colossal living ship \u2014 <strong>half whale, half war machine</strong> \u2014 and soar across the infinite Sea of Clouds. <br> <br>Recruit Officers with unique powers, upgrade your ship, and lead them into evolving roguelite Hunts filled with explosive sky battles and colossal <strong>Behemoths</strong>. <br> <br>Strategize, adapt, and abordage enemy vessels as you carve your way to power. <br>Every victory in the skies strengthens your dominion on the ground \u2014 <strong>and every defeat only feeds the storm.</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611170/extras/3be45dde768e13b9b4352d5db544ff70.poster.avif?t=1765790443\" 